DESCRIPTION:This event will be offered in person and as a webcast. We will 
 provide the webcast link after you RSVP.\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/f
 ocus-on-eurasia-innovation-on-steroids-what-are-we-learning-from-the-ukrai
